// Each montReduce input is bounded by 2·(q-1)², which fits in uint64 below
// the q·2³² safe range.
//
// Coefficient layout: (a0..a5) ↔ (B0.A0, B0.A1, B1.A0, B1.A1, B2.A0, B2.A1);
// (a0,a1)+(a2,a3)·v+(a4,a5)·v² with v³ = u+1, u² = α.
